      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_1",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Barkeep, I need access to your back room.",
      "JA_current": "バーキープ、奥の部屋を使わせてくれ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "0",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:barman_room_dialog_phrase_2#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2349,
      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_2",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "And why is that? I don't usually let people snoop around back there.",
      "JA_current": "何のためにだ？ 普段はあそこに人を立ち入らせたりしないんだがな。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "1",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:barman_room_dialog_phrase_3#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2352,
      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I just need a good place to rest. Don't worry, I won't touch any of your stuff. Sid can vouch for me.",
      "JA_current": "ゆっくり休める場所が欲しいだけだ。心配するな、あんたの物には一切手を触れない。シドロビッチに聞いてもらえば保証してくれる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "2",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:barman_room_dialog_phrase_4#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2355,
      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_4",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Well, I guess we can figure something out, but it won't be cheap.",
      "JA_current": "まあ、融通を利かせてやれなくもないが、安くはないぞ。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "3",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:barman_room_dialog_phrase_5#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2358,
      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_5",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Artifacts or cash?",
      "JA_current": "アーティファクトか？ それとも現金か？",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "4",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:barman_room_dialog_phrase_6#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2361,
      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_6",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "I suppose an artifact will do. If you want access to the back room, how about you bring over a \"Flash\"? Then you can go there whenever you want.",
      "JA_current": "アーティファクトがいいな。奥の部屋を使いたいなら、「フラッシュ」を一つ持ってきてもらおうか。そうすりゃ、いつでも好きな時に出入りさせてやる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "5",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "key": "stable_dialogs_bar:barman_room_dialog_phrase_7#1",
      "source_table": "stable_dialogs_bar",
      "source_file": "F:\\Games\\Radiophobia 3\\gamedata\\config\\text\\jpn\\stable_dialogs_bar.xml",
      "source_xml_line": 2364,
      "string_id": "barman_room_dialog_phrase_7",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Got it, I'll go and get it.",
      "JA_current": "分かった、取ってくる。",
      "review_notes": null,
      "english_reference_status": "same_table_and_id_occurrence",
      "review_flags": [],
      "graph_uses": [
        {
          "dialog_id": "barman_room_dialog",
          "phrase_id": "6",
          "graph_source": "gamedata/config/gameplay/dialogs_bar.xml"
        }
